<title>UK: Dated Brent sells at lower Nov -5 cents.</title>
<headline>Dated Brent sells at lower Nov -5 cents.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Physical Brent sold at a lower November less five cents on Friday, down five cents from a deal on Thursday, traders said.</p>
<p>The sale was for an October 28-30 Brent cargo kept early in the day from six nominated loading dates on Friday.</p>
<p>One other date was also kept early.</p>
<p>Dated Brent was trading as high as Nov plus 10 cents on Wednesday.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 8060</p>
